ence also reveals that there was a wavering between two opinions: Paganism and Christianity.\n\nhttps://www.livescience.com/archaeology/900-year-old-burials-of-denmarks-early-christians-discovered-in-medieval-cemetery\n", "author": "ContendersEdge", "created": 1786708916617, "profile_picture": "OTUZVRkFHNZn", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "The_Emperor", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The presence of Christianity in Denmark is reported to be traced back as early as the 10th century but archaeological evidence also reveals that there was a wavering between two opinions: \n", "last_comment_created": 1786712225547, "content": "<p>The presence of Christianity in Denmark is reported to be traced back as early as the 10th century but archaeological evidence also reveals that there was a wavering between two opinions: Paganism and Christianity.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.livescience.com/archaeology/900-year-old-burials-of-denmarks-early-christians-discovered-in-medieval-cemetery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.livescience.com/archaeology/900-year-old-burials-of-denmarks-early-christians-discovered-in-medieval-cemetery</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 7, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2087558402402570246", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCEB6xGh", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 7, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 877